WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.286
I just wanted to say
that, um,

00:00:03.286 --> 00:00:04.865
we've all made
terrible decisions,

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.025
but this'll be a good one

00:00:07.025 --> 00:00:09.017
and I'm so honored
to be here

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:10.520
celebrating this
beautiful couple.

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:13.253
So everybody,
let's raise a glass

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:15.580
to love,
laughter,

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:19.020
and welcoming
a new baby into this world.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:20.567
(crowd gasps)

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:22.147
#

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:26.303
Um...

00:00:26.303 --> 00:00:27.802
I'm so sorry.
Um...

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:30.080
Cheers! Yeah!

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:31.623
#

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:34.700
(scattered applause)

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:35.743
So good.

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:37.900
You guys...

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.900
I--she can't be the one bride

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:42.120
that's gained weight
for her wedding, right?

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:43.970
-I mean, she's already showing.
-Totally.

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:45.160
Oh my God, you guys,
was it that bad?

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.320
Oh yeah, it was really bad.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:47.816
I'm, like, kind of
attracted to you right now.

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:48.820
Todd!

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:50.568
Okay, okay,
it wasn't as bad

00:00:50.568 --> 00:00:52.061
as our wedding ceremony.

00:00:52.061 --> 00:00:53.269
-You remember?
-Bad!

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:55.836
That was the best.
I, personally, had a great time.

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:57.133
-Really?
-I loved it.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.475
Good, I wept
through our honeymoon.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:00.394
Lucy, I will love you,

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:02.620
honor you,
cherish you.

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:04.803
I will...

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:06.883
Um...

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:09.363
(clears throat)

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:14.660
You are my inspiration
to stay in shape

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:16.809
and we will go to the gym.

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:18.802
We will get memberships
together and...

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:20.979
Oh, I totally forgot
about that.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:22.649
-See?
-Yeah, and we got over it.

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:23.840
I...kinda didn't.

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:25.867
Remember, I'm still
in therapy?

00:01:25.867 --> 00:01:27.598
You're in therapy
for a million other reasons.

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:29.054
-Can we not do this here?
-Nope, yeah, that's--yeah.

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:30.520
It wasn't as great
as the time Milo had

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:32.557
the little jaunt
down Romance Lane.

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:34.655
-Oh God.
-Oh, that's right.

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:35.995
Are you talking about what
I think you're talking about?

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.042
Yeah.

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:38.723
#

00:01:38.723 --> 00:01:40.221
(music stops, crickets chirping)

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:42.930
Come on, Milo.

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:43.789
Pick it up!

00:01:43.789 --> 00:01:44.888
I'm married.

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:46.386
Pick it up, Milo!

00:01:46.386 --> 00:01:47.417
Fine! Okay.

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:50.469
I'm getting married!

00:01:50.469 --> 00:01:51.378
(cheering)

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:52.423
Hey Milo.

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:56.269
You have to go put it on him,
it's tradition.

00:01:56.269 --> 00:01:57.302
Oh...

00:01:57.740 --> 00:01:58.699
Where?

00:01:58.700 --> 00:01:59.743
Let's do it!

00:01:59.743 --> 00:02:00.908
Woo!

00:02:00.908 --> 00:02:02.508
(cheering)

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:04.876
That guy was a stud.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.209
Such a stud.

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:08.128
Remember the farm fiasco?

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:09.622
Oh, that was fun!

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:10.948
-That was fun.
-Farm pics.

00:02:10.948 --> 00:02:12.149
That was insane.

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:14.340
(twangy music plays)

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:16.182
Nice, dude!

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.152
This is the wrong wedding.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:19.994
Yeah, we have to go.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:21.209
The hooch? What?

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:24.018
Oh, you guys, this way.
Come on.

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:25.855
-Love it.
-It's leaving, run!

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:27.470
(car engine roaring)

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:30.096
-Wait, wait, wait, wait!
-Wrong wedding! Wait!

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:33.588
Well, that shuttle won't be back
for at least an hour.

00:02:33.688 --> 00:02:36.015
-Ooo, I know what we can do.
-Come on, take the picture.

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:37.537
Come on. Come on.

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:38.582
Oh! Oh!

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:41.493
Stop this!
I hate this!

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:42.960
You wanna come
live with me?

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:44.378
He's peein' on your dress.

00:02:44.380 --> 00:02:45.882
-What?
-Just an FYI.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:47.326
Oh my gosh, okay.

00:02:47.326 --> 00:02:48.488
(pig squeals)
Shh.

00:02:48.488 --> 00:02:49.522
Go! Ah!

00:02:49.522 --> 00:02:50.855
Please stop it.

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:53.053
Hey! What're you guys doin'?

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:55.081
-Uh...
-Get outta there!

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:57.598
-Sorry!
-I'm sorry.

00:02:57.600 --> 00:02:58.393
Sorry about that.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.442
Man.

00:02:59.442 --> 00:03:00.650
Those stupid chickens.

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:02.008
Baked chicken.

00:03:02.008 --> 00:03:03.035
Oh!

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.043
Really?

00:03:05.043 --> 00:03:05.999
(groans)

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.293
Can I have your broccoli?

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:09.180
A-tink-tink-tink-tink-tink.
Hot mic.

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:10.978
Hi y'all, I'm Jeff,

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:13.065
I'm Brian's good friend
from college.

00:03:13.065 --> 00:03:15.980
Uh, before I congratulate
the happy couple over here,

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:17.899
I just wanted to tell
all of y'all

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:20.444
about this Crowdstarter
fundraiser I just launched.

00:03:20.444 --> 00:03:22.483
It's for a graphic novel
I just wrote

00:03:22.483 --> 00:03:24.483
called "The Blood Oath
of The Wrathners."

00:03:24.483 --> 00:03:25.743
Let me tell you about
what the Wrathners are--

00:03:25.743 --> 00:03:27.803
-I do not feel so bad anymore.
-These things...

00:03:27.803 --> 00:03:29.140
-...are centuries' old...
-I think you're in the clear.

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:31.100
-Oh yeah.
-...vampires who also rap.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:32.320
Do you think he's single?

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:33.780
And these basketball playin'
vampires,

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:34.989
they bite rubber.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:36.486
Do not date that guy.

00:03:36.486 --> 00:03:37.982
I'm not making promises.

00:03:37.982 --> 00:03:41.025
Just one second. Your grandmama
is lovin' it, okay?

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:43.670
Let me tell ya, this is--
this part's for you.

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:44.651
You're gonna love this.

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:45.869
All right, so--

